/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/globalfoundries-gfs-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[7,7,0,6.83],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[1,0,1,0.98],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0595,"r5":-0.0529,"r1_spy":-0.076,"r5_spy":-0.0471}}],"quotes":[{"c":"GFS 2025 Q4","e":"gfs","d":"2026-02-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Timothy Breen","x":"For GLOBALFOUNDRIES Inc., we expect these opportunities to be driven by the most significant megatrends defining our industry today: the rapid scaling of AI data centers, the proliferation of AI into the physical world, and the need for resilient, diversified global semiconductor supply.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/globalfoundries-gfs-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GFS 2025 Q4","e":"gfs","d":"2026-02-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Timothy Breen","x":"The rapid expansion of compute for AI data centers is reshaping demands on infrastructure and creating two critical bottlenecks: networking and power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/globalfoundries-gfs-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GFS 2025 Q4","e":"gfs","d":"2026-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy Breen","x":"Geopolitical tensions, tariffs, and export controls are actively driving firms to reshore or onshore their semiconductor supply.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/globalfoundries-gfs-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GFS 2026 Q1","e":"gfs","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Timothy Breen","x":"Beyond silicon photonics, we also believe we have robust growth and opportunity within our silicon germanium solutions in the AI data center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/globalfoundries-gfs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GFS 2026 Q1","e":"gfs","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Timothy Breen","x":"We hear stats like by 2030, 70% of networking ports in the data center will be optical, and that reflects the complexity of compute and the sheer amount of data that AI workloads require.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/globalfoundries-gfs-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GFS 2026 Q2","e":"gfs","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Timothy Breen","x":"Let me now update you on 3 key developments in the quarter that are accelerating our strategic path: one, Quantum Technology Solutions; two, optical networking and power opportunities in the AI data center; and three, IP, software, and custom silicon.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/globalfoundries-gfs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFS 2026 Q2","e":"gfs","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Timothy Breen","x":"Just as CPUs, GPUs and AI ASICs define today's compute paradigm, we believe quantum processor units, or QPUs, will be an essential part of tomorrow's.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/globalfoundries-gfs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFS 2026 Q2","e":"gfs","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Muse","x":"And so curious, given your commentary around selective price increases and how you're going to continue to look at that into calendar '27, how are you thinking about the prioritization of drivers between kind of mix, pricing and utilization?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/globalfoundries-gfs-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GFS 2026 Q3","e":"gfs","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tim Breen","x":"Let me now turn to our significant and expanding opportunity in the AI data center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earni